menuconfig ZECTRIX_ENABLE_CONNECTIVITY
    bool "Companion connectivity"
    default y
    help
        Enable BLE pairing, durable companion sync and phone resource requests.
        Uses the NimBLE peripheral configuration in sdkconfig.defaults.
        Disable to remove the connectivity, companion and NFC enrollment services.

config ZECTRIX_ENABLE_WIFI
    bool "Direct Wi-Fi"
    depends on ZECTRIX_ENABLE_CONNECTIVITY
    default y
    help
        Enable the shared AP/STA radio driver and RF scan diagnostics.
        BLE companion sync remains available when this option is disabled.

config ZECTRIX_ENABLE_WIFI_HTTP
    bool "Direct HTTPS resource client"
    depends on ZECTRIX_ENABLE_WIFI
    default y
    help
        Fetch resources directly over Wi-Fi with certificate and date validation.
        Disabling this option removes the HTTPS client and its TLS transport.
        Phone resource requests and local Web book transfer remain independent.

config ZECTRIX_ENABLE_BOOK_TRANSFER
    bool "Web book transfer"
    depends on ZECTRIX_ENABLE_WIFI
    default y
    help
        Enable the temporary authenticated AP/STA Web library and SEND BOOKS scene.
        Does not require the reader or the HTTPS resource client.
